; Redraw cells: attribute of each queued cell
;
; One byte per queued cell: the attribute from #R$CE00, indexed by the cell index of the run list (#R$C200); #R$976B
; fills it, the sprite drawers change it, #R$95FF writes it to the attribute file (high byte PAGE_REDRAW_ATTRS).
@label=RedrawAttrs
g$C400 DEFS $0100,$FF ;
